This repository does not contain benchmark images. It contains photo ids for every track, model predictions, and,
for the tracks whose license allows it, reference labels derived from the datasets below. Each dataset keeps its
own license; using a track means accepting the terms of its source.

Nutrition5k (overhead and angled tracks)
  Thames et al., "Nutrition5k: Towards Automatic Nutritional Understanding of Generic Food", CVPR 2021.
  https://github.com/google-research-datasets/Nutrition5k, CC BY 4.0.
  The angled track uses calorie-lens-data by shalev396
  (https://huggingface.co/datasets/shalev396/calorie-lens-data), CC BY 4.0, which repackages Nutrition5k.
  references/overhead.jsonl and references/angled.jsonl are derived from these datasets under CC BY 4.0.

SNAPMe
  Larke et al., "Surveying Nutrient Assessment with Photographs of Meals (SNAPMe): A Benchmark Dataset of Food
  Photos for Dietary Assessment", Nutrients 15(23):4972, 2023. USDA Ag Data Commons,
  doi:10.15482/USDA.ADC/1528346, CC BY-SA 4.0.
  references/snapme.jsonl is derived from SNAPMe and is shared under CC BY-SA 4.0.

January Food Benchmark (JFB)
  Hosseinian et al., "January Food Benchmark (JFB): A Public Benchmark Dataset and Evaluation Suite for
  Multimodal Food Analysis", arXiv:2508.09966, 2025. CC BY 4.0.
  references/jfb.jsonl is derived from JFB under CC BY 4.0.

NutritionVerse-Real
  Tai et al., "NutritionVerse-Real: An Open Access Manually Collected 2D Food Scene Dataset for Dietary Intake
  Estimation", arXiv:2401.08598, 2023. Kaggle nutritionverse/nutritionverse-real. No license is stated.
  Only photo ids are included here.

DiningBench
  Jin et al., "DiningBench: A Hierarchical Multi-view Benchmark for Perception and Reasoning in the Dietary
  Domain", ACL 2026, arXiv:2604.10425. Hugging Face meituan/DiningBench, CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.
  Only photo ids and model predictions are included here; no reference labels or images.

OmniFood8K
  Yu et al., "OmniFood8K: Single-Image Nutrition Estimation via Hierarchical Frequency-Aligned Fusion", CVPR 2026,
  arXiv:2604.12356. The download has no license file. Only photo ids are included here.
